<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Slide on NaiNai</title><link>https://npujol.github.io/en/tags/slide/</link><description>Recent Posts in Slide on NaiNai</description><generator>Hugo 0.163.3</generator><language>en-GB</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 23:42:20 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://npujol.github.io/en/tags/slide/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Configure Slides</title><link>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-slides/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><dc:creator>Nainai</dc:creator><guid>https://npujol.github.io/en/post/configure-slides/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="slide-configuration"&gt;Slide Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Slides are used in the home page carousel. Create pages with &lt;code&gt;type: 'slide'&lt;/code&gt; to add slides.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="creating-slides"&gt;Creating Slides&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;type: &amp;#39;slide&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;title: &amp;#39;My Slide Title&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cover: &amp;#39;/img/slide-cover.jpg&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;weight: 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;params:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; headless: true
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;This is the slide content.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="slide-parameters"&gt;Slide Parameters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;type: 'slide'&lt;/code&gt; — Required, identifies this as a slide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;title&lt;/code&gt; — Slide title displayed in navigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;cover&lt;/code&gt; — Cover image URL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;weight&lt;/code&gt; — Order of slides (lower = first)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.headless: true&lt;/code&gt; — Hides the page from regular listings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.target&lt;/code&gt; — External URL to link to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="navigation"&gt;Navigation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The slide navigation appears when there are three or more slides. With fewer slides, the navigation is hidden for a cleaner look.&lt;/p&gt;</description><content:encoded>&lt;h2 id="slide-configuration"&gt;Slide Configuration&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Slides are used in the home page carousel. Create pages with &lt;code&gt;type: 'slide'&lt;/code&gt; to add slides.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="creating-slides"&gt;Creating Slides&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;type: &amp;#39;slide&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;title: &amp;#39;My Slide Title&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cover: &amp;#39;/img/slide-cover.jpg&amp;#39;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;weight: 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;params:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; headless: true
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;This is the slide content.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="slide-parameters"&gt;Slide Parameters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;type: 'slide'&lt;/code&gt; — Required, identifies this as a slide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;title&lt;/code&gt; — Slide title displayed in navigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;cover&lt;/code&gt; — Cover image URL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;weight&lt;/code&gt; — Order of slides (lower = first)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.headless: true&lt;/code&gt; — Hides the page from regular listings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;params.target&lt;/code&gt; — External URL to link to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="navigation"&gt;Navigation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The slide navigation appears when there are three or more slides. With fewer slides, the navigation is hidden for a cleaner look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="flowlines"&gt;Flowlines&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enable flowlines in the homepage for a decorative background:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-toml" data-lang="toml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;feed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;flowlines&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;flowlinesLimit&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;21&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content:encoded><category>Homepage</category></item></channel></rss>